WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Use the architecture questions
to expose unresolved decisions.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.240
Where is idempotency
enforced across the API,

00:00:06.311 --> 00:00:10.080
provider request,
journal and callback handler?

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.360
Which artifact proves one
posting after a lost response?

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.760
Can two engineers reproduce the same
failure from fresh fixtures?

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:23.240
Who owns provider-model drift,
failed cleanup and evidence retention?

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:25.680
Resolve these questions
with the client system owners

00:00:25.726 --> 00:00:28.320
before giving an agent
broader execution authority.
